<div class="step cur"><span class="sr">&lt;3.0</span><span class="sn">弱修<small>缩量分歧</small></span><span class="sd"><span class="dayc">10-12 1.54</span><span class="dayc">10-13 1.68</span><span class="dayc now">10-14 1.41</span></span></div>
</div><div class="hint">量能 1.41 万亿落&quot;弱修&quot;档 —— 米开量能台阶换算(手册V2 §2.3 A档, 腾讯替代源); 当日涨停36/温度17.9(冰点), 档位与温度档冰点联动判读。</div></div>

<!--/VOLSTEP--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-9ddd8d492b2a50bf"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-d9844543030dfd97"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><h3>量能缩至1.41万亿再降一档 · 宽度二次塌陷（涨停67→36、封板率77.9%→60.0%破退潮线）· 高度微修复（最高3→4板，三只4板分属三线）· 温度首入冰点17.9 · 攻防冰点防守上限≤12%</h3></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-82667aec087d35b3"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>量能台阶→先行指标三窗→五路周期投票→连板梯队→攻防总开关。周期路只做环境判定，不荐个股、不写交易计划。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-7c9868924f52f669"></span><span id="claim-cycle-175542d0ce9fc069"></span><span id="claim-cycle-3248170d06392467"></span><span id="claim-cycle-462e134b650b45a3"></span><span id="claim-cycle-59db76462342d9ac"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-3c08197a278b1692"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>↘缩量 -15.6%两市量能14144亿两市成交额14144.0亿元，约1.4144万亿元；环比20261013的16759.0亿元-15.6%（缩量），自1.5-1.7万亿台阶档降至1.3-1.5万亿档，仍低于3万亿口径的退潮线</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-157a793cb90f5dba"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>◷主判·冰点情绪阶段冰点温度17.9首入冰点档（前值31.6，Δ-13.7）；涨停36、炸板24、跌停11、炸板率40.0%、封板率60.0%、回封21、二板加15、最高板4</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-3a3bccc676f7b20e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>♨冰点市场温度17.9冰点偏冷中性偏热过热温度17.9、冰点档；前值31.6（Δ-13.7），为本轮首次落入冰点档（&lt;25）</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-6b55befc50eee51a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>⌁总仓位上限≤12%执行状态冰点防守置信度76/100（周期主判）；五路阶段票5/5全为冰点、方向票降3平2升0，方向一致率60%（3/5）未触发回声室警示</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-73225eea4870d40a"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-e6d275a3dbff1585"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>两市成交额14144.0亿元（约1.41万亿）：环比前一交易日20261013的16759.0亿元为-15.6%，是缩量，方向与20261013的放量回升（+9.0%）相反。按规则表落「1.3-1.5万亿:抱团+套利」台阶档，较前一日的1.5-1.7万亿档下降一档；同时仍明显低于2026.6起中枢3万亿+口径的「跌破3万亿=退潮线」，更低于看多3.3万亿/主升3.5万亿门槛，量能处于退潮区并继续恶化。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-67a8270a06ef03e3"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>按规则表量能→高度对照（1.3万亿约7-9板、1.7万亿约9-11板），14144亿对应的理论高度区间约7-9板，而当日实际最高仅4板，量与高度背离3-5个板位——与前一日的背离6-8板相比缺口收窄，但收窄的原因是高度端从3板修到4板、而非量能回升：钱更少了、高度反而略回，属存量资金抱团少数高标，不构成量能驱动的修复。</p></div></section><section id="leading"><h2>二 先行指标 · 三窗触发器</h2><div id="component-LEADIND"><!--LEADIND--><div class="card"><p style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">情绪先行指标 · 近20日 <span class="mut" style="font-weight:400">(脚本段A档 · 情绪先行指标.py --card · 当日温度 —,阈值冰点&lt;25/过热≥85)</span></p><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683">涨停数_净=36</div><svg viewBox="0 0 880 196" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block"><line x1="46" y1="172" x2="866" y2="172" stroke="#3a3f46"></line><line x1="46" y1="143.0" x2="866" y2="143.0" stroke="#8a6d2f" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="0.8"></line><text x="866" y="140.0" font-size="8.5" fill="#8a6d2f" text-anchor="end">1进2率10%=接力冰点参考线</text><rect x="55.8" y="95.3" width="21.3" height="76.7" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="66.5" y="92" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">52</text><rect x="96.8" y="107.1" width="21.3" height="64.9" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="107.5" y="104" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">44</text><rect x="137.8" y="114.4" width="21.3" height="57.6" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="148.5" y="111" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">39</text><rect x="178.8" y="34.8" width="21.3" height="137.2" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="189.5" y="32" fo